#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "384_Sodachi"
msgid "Congratulations, Tokita-chan!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "396_Saejima"
msgid "Good job."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "408_Tokita"
msgid "Heheh. Did you expect anything less? And now I can finally give those guys hell..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "420_Saejima"
msgid "Those guys...? Wait, are ya talkin' about－"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "432_Tokita"
msgid "That's right. The guys from my previous dojo."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "444_Tokita"
msgid "They looked down on me and treated me like dirt. The truth is, I wanted to become a champion so that I could get back at them."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "456_Sodachi"
msgid "Really...?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "468_Tokita"
msgid "Yeah. I just called them, so they should be here soon."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "480_Tokita"
msgid "Heheheh. I can't wait to see their pathetic faces when they apologize to me..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "492_Tokita"
msgid "Maybe I should make them get down on their knees and beg. Heh..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "504_Sodachi"
msgid "Beg for forgiveness...!? Don't you think that's taking it a bit too far?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "516_Tokita"
msgid "Not even close. If they don't want to get on their knees, I'll force them to the ground myself!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "528_Tokita"
msgid "I'm the champion. They're no match for me now."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "540_Tokita"
msgid "I'll make those hardheads eat their words and see just how strong I am."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "552_Tokita"
msgid "Then they'll really feel like idiots for treating me with no respect."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "564_Tokita"
msgid "I can't wait. Heheheh. Hahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "576_Sodachi"
msgid "Uh-oh... Saejima-san, what should we do? Do you think we should intervene?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "588_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "600_Young Voice"
msgid "Hello...?"
msgstr "¿Hola...?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "624_Tokita"
msgid "So you came... Heheh... I'm going to make you regret the way you treated－"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "636_Man in Brown Sportswear"
msgid "Tokita-kun! You did it! You're a champion!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "648_Tokita"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Uh, ¿y eso?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "660_Man in Brown Sportswear"
msgid "We were totally surprised! We were at the championship match, watching you fight."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "672_Man in Brown Sportswear"
msgid "I thought I recognized that face from somewhere. And it was you!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "684_Man in White Sportswear"
msgid "I can't believe someone that we used to train with became a champion! I'm so proud! Maybe we would be as good as you if we joined this dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "696_Man in Purple Sportswear"
msgid "I always thought you had what it takes. Hey, would it be okay if we took a picture together? I want to show it off to my friends!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "708_Tokita"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Sí..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "768_Saejima"
msgid "How'd it go with yer old dojo mates?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "780_Tokita"
msgid "Kind of anticlimactic... I can't believe I used to be pushed around by such a bunch of airheads. I feel like an idiot..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "792_Saejima"
msgid "People who disrespect n' bully others ain't worth a second of yer time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "804_Tokita"
msgid "Yeah. Oh man, I can't believe I did all of this to get back at them. Ugh... I'm so lame."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "816_Saejima"
msgid "But it made ya a stronger man. Ain't that right?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "828_Sodachi"
msgid "He's right. Sure, your reason for fighting was questionable and the end result was a joke..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "840_Sodachi"
msgid "But nothing can change the fact that you worked tremendously hard."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "852_Sodachi"
msgid "While those guys laughed and looked down on you, you continued to work as hard as you could, no?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "864_Sodachi"
msgid "That's why I'm proud of you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "876_Tokita"
msgid "Sodachi-san..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "888_Saejima"
msgid "He's right, Tokita. Even if the result is meaningless, there's meanin' in how hard ya worked to get where you are today."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "900_Tokita"
msgid "Saejima... Sensei..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "912_Tokita"
msgid "You're right. Heheheh."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "924_Tokita"
msgid "I'm surprised to hear such stirring speeches from you guys."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "936_Sodachi"
msgid "I'm known to give my share of inspirational speeches! Anyway, you're the champion now, so wear the title proudly. Go lady-killer!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "948_Tokita"
msgid "You're right. Now that I'm champion I should keep winning and build up my name."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "960_Tokita"
msgid "Then everyone in the whole world will know this handsome face!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "972_Tokita"
msgid "Yeah! I'm getting motivated now! I think it's time to get back to training!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "984_Sodachi"
msgid "Heheh. Now that he has a new goal, it looks like he's back to his usual self."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "996_Sodachi"
msgid "I hope he's able to reach this new goal too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1008_Saejima"
msgid "Haha... I'm sure he can."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1092_Sodachi"
msgid "The dojo's rank has increased."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1152_Sodachi"
msgid "The dojo's rank increased! Now more apprentices are sure to join, and the money will start flowing! Heheheh!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1164_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1236_Sodachi"
msgid "The dojo's rank decreased! This is a nightmare... Ugh, my chest hurts... The stress is killing me! Saejima-san! Do something!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1248_Saejima"
msgid "(Will he pipe down already...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1320_Tokita"
msgid "I can't believe that I actually lost... It must be the dojo's fault."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1332_Sodachi"
msgid "It's too bad about the loss. Seems like he's pretty down about it, too. I think he may have lost trust in us..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1344_Sodachi"
msgid "But at least it was good practice. And I'm sure it was a wake-up call for him, too. Now let's work towards getting revenge!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1428_Sodachi"
msgid "You did it! That was a spectacular win! We knew that you could do it, Tokita-chan! And you even won us some money!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1440_Tokita"
msgid "Heheh... It was nothing. I just feel sorry for the poor guy that had to fight me. Heheh..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1452_Sodachi"
msgid "Looks like he's refined his skills <Italic>and</Italic> his ego! Keep this up and he'll be the most famous narcissist－oops, I mean, champion－ever!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1500_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Dragon's Gate.\tThis is a match for beginning fighters. The level of entry isn't high, so it's perfect for practice."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1512_Sodachi"
msgid "This is the beginning of all history. Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1524_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Brawlfest."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1536_Sodachi"
msgid "Fighting connoisseurs! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1548_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Regular Tryouts. This is a match held regularly at the Coliseum for mid-level fighters."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1560_Sodachi"
msgid "Well, time's a-wasting! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1572_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Shuffle Zone. The skill levels of the fighters in this match are unknown."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1584_Sodachi"
msgid "I hope your opponent isn't too strong... Wow, my heart is racing! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1596_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Big Money match. The prize purse for winning this match is incredible! Money! MONEY! Heheheh!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1608_Sodachi"
msgid "All right, let's go! Go Sodachi Dojo! Go get me that money!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1620_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Rising Stars. This is a famous event where young fighters with great potential gather to prove themselves. A true first step."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1632_Sodachi"
msgid "Well, time's a-wasting! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1644_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Sink or Swim match. This is an event for fighters who are just getting started. Let your skills speak for you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1656_Sodachi"
msgid "Believe in your own abilities! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1668_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Winner's Circle. This is an event for undefeated fighters. Be ready for some strong competition."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1680_Sodachi"
msgid "You won't be able to compete again if you lose, so make sure to win! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1692_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Veteran's Showdown. This is an event for fighters with a long training history."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1704_Sodachi"
msgid "It's time to put what you've learned to the test and show 'em who we are! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1716_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Coliseum Opening Fight.\\r\nIt's an extremely high-profile match that is, you guessed it, the opening event at the Coliseum!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1728_Sodachi"
msgid "This kind of attention-grabbing fight attracts some pretty strong fighters, but that's no reason for you to lose! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1740_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in King of the Mountain. This is a very high-level match for skilled fighters who have what it takes to be champion."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1752_Sodachi"
msgid "Brush up your own skills by fighting stronger opponents. Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1764_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Power Masters."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1776_Sodachi"
msgid "Fighters proud of their power gather at this event, so the fights are sure to be intense. Give it your all, super Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1788_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Speed Masters."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1800_Sodachi"
msgid "Fighters proud of their level of speed gather at this event. You're perfect for this one! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1812_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Technique Masters."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1824_Sodachi"
msgid "Only fighters with superior technique fight in this event, so stay focused! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1836_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Rookie Stars. As the name suggests, this is a match for rookie fighters aiming to be number one."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1848_Sodachi"
msgid "This is the highest level match, so make sure you're ready. Go Sodachi Dojo, the strongest dojo in Kamurocho!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1872_Tokita"
msgid "I can't believe that I actually lost... It must be the dojo's fault."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1884_Sodachi"
msgid "It's too bad about the loss. Seems like he's pretty down about it, too. I think he may have lost some trust in us..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1896_Sodachi"
msgid "But at least it was good practice. And I'm sure it was a wake-up call for him, too. Now let's work towards getting revenge!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1992_Sodachi"
msgid "Now it's time to participate in a tournament. Tokita-chan, I'm sure you'll be able to win and bring us back some money!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2004_Saejima"
msgid "He's right. You're Captain Confident, so I don't wanna compliment ya too much. But you're definitely the man for the job. You can do it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2016_Tokita"
msgid "Heheh... Of course. I'll be the winner, don't worry about that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2028_Sodachi"
msgid "Go out there and prove to us that you're not just some narcissist! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2064_Sodachi"
msgid "Wow, you really are an amazing fighter! I'm sure Tokita-chan learned a lot, too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2076_Tokita"
msgid "Not bad... I took it easy on you this fight, but I'll be getting my revenge next time for sure."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2088_Saejima"
msgid "Heheheh... Well, you can come at me any time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2184_Sodachi"
msgid "Sparring or not, I can't believe he beat you! Looks like he's getting a lot stronger!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2196_Tokita"
msgid "Mwahahaha! You're not as strong as I'd expected. I've already surpassed my own teacher! Hahaha! I'm the best!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2208_Sodachi"
msgid "I think he's getting a bit carried away. It may have been good practice, but make sure to give him a good fight too, Saejima-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2292_Sodachi"
msgid "It's time for some sparring. Saejima-san, show Tokita-chan who's boss and knock that arrogant smirk off his face!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2304_Saejima"
msgid "Heh... I'll teach him how tough reality can be. I ain't gonna take it easy on you, kid."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2316_Tokita"
msgid "Heheh. We'll see. Today's going to be your last day as teacher, old man! Let's get this started!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2340_Sodachi"
msgid "You want him to try solo training? This means you have trust in your apprentice and leave their training up to them. How beautiful."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2352_Saejima"
msgid "All right. You can choose yer own trainin' routine. Just don't go slackin' off."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2364_Tokita"
msgid "Heh... Of course. I don't know how <Italic>not</Italic> to work hard. Just sit back and watch a miracle..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2424_Saejima"
msgid "How was it? Ya learn anythin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2436_Tokita"
msgid "It went perfectly, of course! Perhaps I was born only for the purpose of solo training!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2448_Saejima"
msgid "(Right... Ain't sure what that means, but at least it sounds like it went well.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2484_Saejima"
msgid "How was it? Ya learn anythin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2496_Tokita"
msgid "It went all right. I could have done things more efficiently, but I'll save some of the fun for next time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2508_Saejima"
msgid "(Not too bad. I guess...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2544_Saejima"
msgid "How was it? Ya learn anythin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2556_Tokita"
msgid "Shut up! Shut up! Shut up! It's not my fault! Not my fault I tell you!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2568_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess it didn't go well... That ain't good.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2652_Saejima"
msgid "How's about we rest this time? Rest is important too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2664_Sodachi"
msgid "Yay! That's a wonderful idea! Let's rest away!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2748_Tokita"
msgid "Zzz..."
msgstr "Zzz..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2760_Sodachi"
msgid "*snores* Gaaaa... Gaaaa... *snores* Mmmm..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2796_Sodachi"
msgid "Googa googa... *snores* Nyaar... *snores*\\r\nHeheh, but I can't eat anymore... *snores*"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2808_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2880_Sodachi"
msgid "Wow! I feel so refreshed! Resting really is necessary sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2964_Saejima"
msgid "All right. This time I'm gonna teach ya a potential Finishing Move."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2976_Saejima"
msgid "(Which move should I teach 'im?)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3012_Saejima"
msgid "Okay, let's get started."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3024_Saejima"
